  "configuration_id": "config_008",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (config_002) and scvi_n200 encoder (config_005) significantly improve RNA-only performance. This experiment tests scgpt encoder in the same multiprofile/avgpool setup (config_008), isolating the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly compares scvi_n200 (current best) vs scgpt, a newer encoder, to determine if encoder architecture is a critical factor. This addresses uncertainty about whether encoder improvements can surpass existing gains, while building on the strong evidence for multiprofile/avgpool as a promising direction."
}

